{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Patchset 2 CI caught a regression: the any-position help scan wrongly intercepted 'bridge preview --help' (nested-dispatch family owns its children's help) and broke 'bridge --help' == 'help bridge' parity. Fixed with a family-aware _help_requested(sub, rest): bridge* honor only a LEADING --help (child flags reach bridge_cli), all other commands scan any position before a -- terminator. Added unit coverage (_wants_help + _help_requested param tests). Verified locally: full tests/interfaces/facades+contracts help/dispatch set 362 passed, test_cli_argparse parity + bridge heldout green, lint/typecheck/complexity clean. Pushed patchset 3 to Gerrit 1897."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787131013438324001,"uuid":"4f6ed45b-1297-4308-9c19-deb96f50d40c"}